      ],
      "image": "assets/images/220810/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Beat egg, garlic, salt, and black pepper together in a large bowl.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/z2mD2eMla091dbXiHft-nVtt8t0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/220810-spinach-stuffed-portobello-mushrooms-ddmfs-step-3-5566-0620a1c998474ecb99ee4b6e44123d95.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/220810/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Stir spinach, pepperoni, Parmesan cheese, 3 tablespoons mozzarella cheese, and 3 tablespoons bread crumbs into eggs until evenly mixed.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
